# guess the number game

me has secret random 1 to 10
me has tries 0
me has found no

say "me think of number from 1 to 10. guess it!"

repeat while found is no
    me has guess ask "your guess?"

    if kind of guess is not "number"
        say "that not a number. try again."
        skip

    tries gain 1

    if guess is secret
        found is yes
    else if guess is small secret
        say "too small"
    else
        say "too big"

say "yes! it was " + secret + ". you took " + tries + " tries."
